                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/8612: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-11-24T12:00:00-06:00">November 24,
                        1936—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 2:27 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>233. Committees representing conservative and liberal supporters of biparty
                    agreement met yesterday and decided to abstain from voting on December 8th thus
                    virtually withdrawing Argüello-Espinosa ticket and leaving Somoza as sole
                    Presidential candidate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
